      "writtenOn": "2020-09-14T12:23:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I get duplicate install rules in the snapshot, which I believe come from the installSnapshot calls below.\n\n```\nFAILED: ninja: out/soong/build.ninja:10059010: multiple rules generate out/soong/vendor-snapshot/x86/arch-x86/static/libasync_safe.a [-w dupbuild\u003d\nerr]\n```\n\nFrom build.ninja:\n\n```\nbuild out/soong/vendor-snapshot/x86/arch-x86/static/libasync_safe.a: $\n        g.android.Cp $\n        out/soong/.intermediates/bionic/libc/async_safe/libasync_safe/android_vendor.S_x86_static/libasync_safe.a\n    description \u003d Cp vendor-snapshot/x86/arch-x86/static/libasync_safe.a\n    cpFlags \u003d -f -L\n/.../\nbuild out/soong/vendor-snapshot/x86/arch-x86/static/libasync_safe.a: $\n        g.android.Cp $\n        prebuilts/runtime/mainline/runtime/sdk/android/x86/lib/libasync_safe.a\n    description \u003d Cp vendor-snapshot/x86/arch-x86/static/libasync_safe.a\n    cpFlags \u003d -f -L\n```\n\nOne is from the libasync_safe source cc_library in bionic, the other is from the prebuilt snapshot of that library.",
      "parentUuid": "62f9f2b6_3d196093",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 817,
        "startChar": 2,
        "endLine": 817,
        "endChar": 31
      },
