      "message": "Thanks for testing, Inseob.\n\nThe use of SkipInstall is part of the generic prebuilt selection logic in android/prebuilt.go, so I think this situation can happen anywhere where there\u0027s a static cc_library and a cc_prebuilt_library with the same name. Hence I don\u0027t think it\u0027s restricted to SDKs, more than that SDK snapshots will make it more likely to occur.\n\n\u003e Can we move this to isVendorSnapshotModule function?\n\nDone.",
